[
  {
    "content_id": "10017001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;亚哈随鲁作王，从印度直到古实，统管一百二十七省。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;亚哈随鲁王在书珊城的宫登基；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;在位第三年，为他一切首领臣仆设摆筵席，有波斯和米底亚的权贵，就是各省的贵胄与首领，在他面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他把他荣耀之国的丰富和他美好威严的尊贵给他们看了许多日，就是一百八十日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;这日子满了，又为所有住书珊城的大小人民在御园的院子里设摆筵席七日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;有白色、绿色、蓝色的帐子，用细麻绳、紫色绳从银环内系在白玉石柱上；有金银的床榻摆在红、白、黄、黑玉石的铺石地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;用金器皿赐酒，器皿各有不同。御酒甚多，足显王的厚意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;喝酒有例，不准勉强人，因王吩咐宫里的一切臣宰，让人各随己意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;王后瓦实提在亚哈随鲁王的宫内也为妇女设摆筵席。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;第七日，亚哈随鲁王饮酒，心中快乐，就吩咐在他面前侍立的七个太监米户幔、比斯他、哈波拿、比革他、亚拔他、西达、甲迦，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;请王后瓦实提头戴王后的冠冕到王面前，使各等臣民看她的美貌，因为她容貌甚美。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;王后瓦实提却不肯遵太监所传的王命而来，所以王甚发怒，心如火烧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:13-14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13-14</sup>&nbsp;那时，在王左右常见王面、国中坐高位的，有波斯和米底亚的七个大臣，就是甲示拿、示达、押玛他、他施斯、米力、玛西拿、米母干，都是达时务的明哲人。按王的常规，办事必先询问知例明法的人。王问他们说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;「王后瓦实提不遵太监所传的王命，照例应当怎样办理呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;米母干在王和众首领面前回答说：「王后瓦实提这事，不但得罪王，并且有害于王各省的臣民；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;因为王后这事必传到众妇人的耳中，说：『亚哈随鲁王吩咐王后瓦实提到王面前，她却不来』，她们就藐视自己的丈夫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;今日波斯和米底亚的众夫人听见王后这事，必向王的大臣照样行；从此必大开藐视和忿怒之端。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;王若以为美，就降旨写在波斯和米底亚人的例中，永不更改，不准瓦实提再到王面前，将她王后的位分赐给比她还好的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;所降的旨意传遍通国（国度本来广大），所有的妇人，无论丈夫贵贱都必尊敬他。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;王和众首领都以米母干的话为美，王就照这话去行，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;发诏书，用各省的文字、各族的方言通知各省，使为丈夫的在家中作主，各说本地的方言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;这事以后，亚哈随鲁王的忿怒止息，就想念瓦实提和她所行的，并怎样降旨办她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;于是王的侍臣对王说：「不如为王寻找美貌的处女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;王可以派官在国中的各省招聚美貌的处女到书珊城的女院，交给掌管女子的太监希该，给她们当用的香品。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;王所喜爱的女子可以立为王后，代替瓦实提。」王以这事为美，就如此行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;书珊城有一个犹大人，名叫末底改，是便雅悯人基士的曾孙，示每的孙子，睚珥的儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;从前巴比伦王尼布甲尼撒将犹大王耶哥尼雅和百姓从耶路撒冷掳去，末底改也在其内。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;末底改抚养他叔叔的女儿哈大沙（后名以斯帖），因为她没有父母。这女子又容貌俊美；她父母死了，末底改就收她为自己的女儿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;王的谕旨传出，就招聚许多女子到书珊城，交给掌管女子的希该；以斯帖也送入王宫，交付希该。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;希该喜悦以斯帖，就恩待她，急忙给她需用的香品和她所当得的分，又派所当得的七个宫女服事她，使她和她的宫女搬入女院上好的房屋。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖未曾将籍贯宗族告诉人，因为末底改嘱咐她不可叫人知道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;末底改天天在女院前边行走，要知道以斯帖平安不平安，并后事如何。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;众女子照例先洁净身体十二个月：六个月用没药油，六个月用香料和洁身之物。满了日期，然后挨次进去见亚哈随鲁王。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;女子进去见王是这样：从女院到王宫的时候，凡她所要的都必给她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;晚上进去，次日回到女子第二院，交给掌管妃嫔的太监沙甲；除非王喜爱她，再提名召她，就不再进去见王。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;末底改叔叔亚比孩的女儿，就是末底改收为自己女儿的以斯帖，按次序当进去见王的时候，除了掌管女子的太监希该所派定给她的，她别无所求。凡看见以斯帖的都喜悦她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;亚哈随鲁王第七年十月，就是提别月，以斯帖被引入宫见王。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;王爱以斯帖过于爱众女，她在王眼前蒙宠爱比众处女更甚。王就把王后的冠冕戴在她头上，立她为王后，代替瓦实提。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;王因以斯帖的缘故给众首领和臣仆设摆大筵席，又豁免各省的租税，并照王的厚意大颁赏赐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;第二次招聚处女的时候，末底改坐在朝门。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖照着末底改所嘱咐的，还没有将籍贯宗族告诉人；因为以斯帖遵末底改的命，如抚养她的时候一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;当那时候，末底改坐在朝门，王的太监中有两个守门的，辟探和提列，恼恨亚哈随鲁王，想要下手害他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;末底改知道了，就告诉王后以斯帖。以斯帖奉末底改的名，报告于王；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;究察这事，果然是实，就把二人挂在木头上，将这事在王面前写于历史上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;这事以后，亚哈随鲁王抬举亚甲族哈米大他的儿子哈曼，使他高升，叫他的爵位超过与他同事的一切臣宰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;在朝门的一切臣仆都跪拜哈曼，因为王如此吩咐；惟独末底改不跪不拜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;在朝门的臣仆问末底改说：「你为何违背王的命令呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他们天天劝他，他还是不听，他们就告诉哈曼，要看末底改的事站得住站不住，因他已经告诉他们自己是犹大人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;哈曼见末底改不跪不拜，他就怒气填胸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他们已将末底改的本族告诉哈曼；他以为下手害末底改一人是小事，就要灭绝亚哈随鲁王通国所有的犹大人，就是末底改的本族。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;亚哈随鲁王十二年正月，就是尼散月，人在哈曼面前，按日日月月掣普珥，就是掣签，要定何月何日为吉，择定了十二月，就是亚达月。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;哈曼对亚哈随鲁王说：「有一种民散居在王国各省的民中；他们的律例与万民的律例不同，也不守王的律例，所以容留他们与王无益。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;王若以为美，请下旨意灭绝他们；我就捐一万他连得银子交给掌管国帑的人，纳入王的府库。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;于是王从自己手上摘下戒指给犹大人的仇敌—亚甲族哈米大他的儿子哈曼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;王对哈曼说：「这银子仍赐给你，这民也交给你，你可以随意待他们。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;正月十三日，就召了王的书记来，照着哈曼一切所吩咐的，用各省的文字、各族的方言，奉亚哈随鲁王的名写旨意，传与总督和各省的省长，并各族的首领；又用王的戒指盖印，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;交给驿卒传到王的各省，吩咐将犹大人，无论老少妇女孩子，在一日之间，十二月，就是亚达月十三日，全然剪除，杀戮灭绝，并夺他们的财为掠物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;抄录这旨意，颁行各省，宣告各族，使他们预备等候那日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;驿卒奉王命急忙起行，旨意也传遍书珊城。王同哈曼坐下饮酒，书珊城的民却都慌乱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;末底改知道所做的这一切事，就撕裂衣服，穿麻衣，蒙灰尘，在城中行走，痛哭哀号。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;到了朝门前停住脚步，因为穿麻衣的不可进朝门。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;王的谕旨所到的各省各处，犹大人大大悲哀，禁食哭泣哀号，穿麻衣躺在灰中的甚多。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;王后以斯帖的宫女和太监来把这事告诉以斯帖，她甚是忧愁，就送衣服给末底改穿，要他脱下麻衣，他却不受。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖就把王所派伺候她的一个太监，名叫哈他革召来，吩咐他去见末底改，要知道这是什么事，是什么缘故。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;于是哈他革出到朝门前的宽阔处见末底改。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;末底改将自己所遇的事，并哈曼为灭绝犹大人应许捐入王库的银数都告诉了他；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;又将所抄写传遍书珊城要灭绝犹大人的旨意交给哈他革，要给以斯帖看，又要给她说明，并嘱咐她进去见王，为本族的人在王面前恳切祈求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;哈他革回来，将末底改的话告诉以斯帖；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖就吩咐哈他革去见末底改，说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;「王的一切臣仆和各省的人民都知道有一个定例：若不蒙召，擅入内院见王的，无论男女必被治死；除非王向他伸出金杖，不得存活。现在我没有蒙召进去见王已经三十日了。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;人就把以斯帖这话告诉末底改。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;末底改托人回复以斯帖说：「你莫想在王宫里强过一切犹大人，得免这祸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;此时你若闭口不言，犹大人必从别处得解脱，蒙拯救；你和你父家必致灭亡。焉知你得了王后的位分不是为现今的机会吗？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖就吩咐人回报末底改说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;「你当去招聚书珊城所有的犹大人，为我禁食三昼三夜，不吃不喝；我和我的宫女也要这样禁食。然后我违例进去见王，我若死就死吧！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;于是末底改照以斯帖一切所吩咐的去行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;第三日，以斯帖穿上朝服，进王宫的内院，对殿站立。王在殿里坐在宝座上，对着殿门。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;王见王后以斯帖站在院内，就施恩于她，向她伸出手中的金杖；以斯帖便向前摸杖头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;王对她说：「王后以斯帖啊，你要什么？你求什么，就是国的一半也必赐给你。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖说：「王若以为美，就请王带着哈曼今日赴我所预备的筵席。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;王说：「叫哈曼速速照以斯帖的话去行。」于是王带着哈曼赴以斯帖所预备的筵席。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;在酒席筵前，王又问以斯帖说：「你要什么，我必赐给你；你求什么，就是国的一半也必为你成就。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖回答说：「我有所要，我有所求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我若在王眼前蒙恩，王若愿意赐我所要的，准我所求的，就请王带着哈曼再赴我所要预备的筵席。明日我必照王所问的说明。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;那日哈曼心中快乐，欢欢喜喜地出来；但见末底改在朝门不站起来，连身也不动，就满心恼怒末底改。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;哈曼暂且忍耐回家，叫人请他朋友和他妻子细利斯来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;哈曼将他富厚的荣耀、众多的儿女，和王抬举他使他超乎首领臣仆之上，都述说给他们听。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;哈曼又说：「王后以斯帖预备筵席，除了我之外不许别人随王赴席。明日王后又请我随王赴席；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;只是我见犹大人末底改坐在朝门，虽有这一切荣耀，也与我无益。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他的妻细利斯和他一切的朋友对他说：「不如立一个五丈高的木架，明早求王将末底改挂在其上，然后你可以欢欢喜喜地随王赴席。」哈曼以这话为美，就叫人做了木架。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;那夜王睡不着觉，就吩咐人取历史来，念给他听。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;正遇见书上写着说：王的太监中有两个守门的，辟探和提列，想要下手害亚哈随鲁王，末底改将这事告诉王后。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;王说：「末底改行了这事，赐他什么尊荣爵位没有？」伺候王的臣仆回答说：「没有赐他什么。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;王说：「谁在院子里？」（那时哈曼正进王宫的外院，要求王将末底改挂在他所预备的木架上。）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;臣仆说：「哈曼站在院内。」王说：「叫他进来。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;哈曼就进去。王问他说：「王所喜悦尊荣的人，当如何待他呢？」哈曼心里说：「王所喜悦尊荣的，不是我是谁呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;哈曼就回答说：「王所喜悦尊荣的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;当将王常穿的朝服和戴冠的御马，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;都交给王极尊贵的一个大臣，命他将衣服给王所喜悦尊荣的人穿上，使他骑上马，走遍城里的街市，在他面前宣告说：王所喜悦尊荣的人，就如此待他。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;王对哈曼说：「你速速将这衣服和马，照你所说的，向坐在朝门的犹大人末底改去行。凡你所说的，一样不可缺。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;于是哈曼将朝服给末底改穿上，使他骑上马，走遍城里的街市，在他面前宣告说：「王所喜悦尊荣的人，就如此待他。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;末底改仍回到朝门，哈曼却忧忧闷闷地蒙着头，急忙回家去了，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;将所遇的一切事详细说给他的妻细利斯和他的众朋友听。他的智慧人和他的妻细利斯对他说：「你在末底改面前始而败落，他如果是犹大人，你必不能胜他，终必在他面前败落。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17006014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他们还与哈曼说话的时候，王的太监来催哈曼快去赴以斯帖所预备的筵席。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;王带着哈曼来赴王后以斯帖的筵席。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;这第二次在酒席筵前，王又问以斯帖说：「王后以斯帖啊，你要什么，我必赐给你；你求什么，就是国的一半也必为你成就。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;王后以斯帖回答说：「我若在王眼前蒙恩，王若以为美，我所愿的，是愿王将我的性命赐给我；我所求的，是求王将我的本族赐给我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因我和我的本族被卖了，要剪除杀戮灭绝我们。我们若被卖为奴为婢，我也闭口不言；但王的损失，敌人万不能补足。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;亚哈随鲁王问王后以斯帖说：「擅敢起意如此行的是谁？这人在哪里呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖说：「仇人敌人就是这恶人哈曼！」 哈曼在王和王后面前就甚惊惶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;王便大怒，起来离开酒席往御园去了。哈曼见王定意要加罪与他，就起来，求王后以斯帖救命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;王从御园回到酒席之处，见哈曼伏在以斯帖所靠的榻上；王说：「他竟敢在宫内、在我面前凌辱王后吗？」这话一出王口，人就蒙了哈曼的脸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;伺候王的一个太监名叫哈波拿，说：「哈曼为那救王有功的末底改做了五丈高的木架，现今立在哈曼家里。」王说：「把哈曼挂在其上。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017007010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 7:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17007010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;于是人将哈曼挂在他为末底改所预备的木架上。王的忿怒这才止息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;当日，亚哈随鲁王把犹大人仇敌哈曼的家产赐给王后以斯帖。末底改也来到王面前，因为以斯帖已经告诉王，末底改是她的亲属。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;王摘下自己的戒指，就是从哈曼追回的，给了末底改。以斯帖派末底改管理哈曼的家产。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖又俯伏在王脚前，流泪哀告，求他除掉亚甲族哈曼害犹大人的恶谋。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;王向以斯帖伸出金杖；以斯帖就起来，站在王前，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;说：「亚甲族哈米大他的儿子哈曼设谋传旨，要杀灭在王各省的犹大人。现今王若愿意，我若在王眼前蒙恩，王若以为美，若喜悦我，请王另下旨意，废除哈曼所传的那旨意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我何忍见我本族的人受害？何忍见我同宗的人被灭呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;亚哈随鲁王对王后以斯帖和犹大人末底改说：「因哈曼要下手害犹大人，我已将他的家产赐给以斯帖，人也将哈曼挂在木架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;现在你们可以随意奉王的名写谕旨给犹大人，用王的戒指盖印；因为奉王名所写、用王戒指盖印的谕旨，人都不能废除。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;三月，就是西弯月二十三日，将王的书记召来，按着末底改所吩咐的，用各省的文字、各族的方言，并犹大人的文字方言写谕旨，传给那从印度直到古实一百二十七省的犹大人和总督省长首领。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;末底改奉亚哈随鲁王的名写谕旨，用王的戒指盖印，交给骑御马圈快马的驿卒，传到各处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:11-12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11-12</sup>&nbsp;谕旨中，王准各省各城的犹大人在一日之间，十二月，就是亚达月十三日，聚集保护性命，剪除杀戮灭绝那要攻击犹大人的一切仇敌和他们的妻子儿女，夺取他们的财为掠物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;抄录这谕旨，颁行各省，宣告各族，使犹大人预备等候那日，在仇敌身上报仇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;于是骑快马的驿卒被王命催促，急忙起行；谕旨也传遍书珊城。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;末底改穿着蓝色白色的朝服，头戴大金冠冕，又穿紫色细麻布的外袍，从王面前出来；书珊城的人民都欢呼快乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;犹大人有光荣，欢喜快乐而得尊贵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017008017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 8:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17008017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;王的谕旨所到的各省各城，犹大人都欢喜快乐，设摆筵宴，以那日为吉日。那国的人民，有许多因惧怕犹大人，就入了犹大籍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;十二月，乃亚达月十三日，王的谕旨将要举行，就是犹大人的仇敌盼望辖制他们的日子，犹大人反倒辖制恨他们的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;犹大人在亚哈随鲁王各省的城里聚集，下手击杀那要害他们的人。无人能敌挡他们，因为各族都惧怕他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;各省的首领、总督、省长，和办理王事的人，因惧怕末底改，就都帮助犹大人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;末底改在朝中为大，名声传遍各省，日渐昌盛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;犹大人用刀击杀一切仇敌，任意杀灭恨他们的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;在书珊城，犹大人杀灭了五百人；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;又杀巴珊大他、达分、亚斯帕他、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;破拉他、亚大利雅、亚利大他、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;帕玛斯他、亚利赛、亚利代、瓦耶撒他；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;这十人都是哈米大他的孙子、犹大人仇敌哈曼的儿子。犹大人却没有下手夺取财物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;当日，将书珊城被杀的人数呈在王前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;王对王后以斯帖说：「犹大人在书珊城杀灭了五百人，又杀了哈曼的十个儿子，在王的各省不知如何呢？现在你要什么，我必赐给你；你还求什么，也必为你成就。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖说：「王若以为美，求你准书珊的犹大人，明日也照今日的旨意行，并将哈曼十个儿子的尸首挂在木架上。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;王便允准如此行。旨意传在书珊，人就把哈曼十个儿子的尸首挂起来了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;亚达月十四日，书珊的犹大人又聚集在书珊，杀了三百人，却没有下手夺取财物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;在王各省其余的犹大人也都聚集保护性命，杀了恨他们的人七万五千，却没有下手夺取财物。这样，就脱离仇敌，得享平安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;亚达月十三日，行了这事；十四日安息，以这日为设筵欢乐的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;但书珊的犹大人，这十三日、十四日聚集杀戮仇敌；十五日安息，以这日为设筵欢乐的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;所以住无城墙乡村的犹大人，如今都以亚达月十四日为设筵欢乐的吉日，彼此馈送礼物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;末底改记录这事，写信与亚哈随鲁王各省远近所有的犹大人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;嘱咐他们每年守亚达月十四、十五两日，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;以这月的两日为犹大人脱离仇敌得平安、转忧为喜、转悲为乐的吉日。在这两日设筵欢乐，彼此馈送礼物，周济穷人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;于是，犹大人按着末底改所写与他们的信，应承照初次所守的守为永例；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;是因犹大人的仇敌亚甲族哈米大他的儿子哈曼设谋杀害犹大人，掣普珥，就是掣签，为要杀尽灭绝他们；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;这事报告于王，王便降旨使哈曼谋害犹大人的恶事归到他自己的头上，并吩咐把他和他的众子都挂在木架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;照着普珥的名字，犹大人就称这两日为「普珥日」。他们因这信上的话，又因所看见所遇见的事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;就应承自己与后裔，并归附他们的人，每年按时必守这两日，永远不废。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;各省各城、家家户户、世世代代纪念遵守这两日，使这「普珥日」在犹大人中不可废掉，在他们后裔中也不可忘记。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;亚比孩的女儿—王后以斯帖和犹大人末底改以全权写第二封信，坚嘱犹大人守这「普珥日」，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;用和平诚实话写信给亚哈随鲁王国中一百二十七省所有的犹大人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009031",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;劝他们按时守这「普珥日」，禁食呼求，是照犹大人末底改和王后以斯帖所嘱咐的，也照犹大人为自己与后裔所应承的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017009032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 9:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17009032",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;以斯帖命定守「普珥日」，这事也记录在书上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017010001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 10:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17010001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;亚哈随鲁王使旱地和海岛的人民都进贡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017010002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 10:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17010002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他以权柄能力所行的，并他抬举末底改使他高升的事，岂不都写在米底亚和波斯王的历史上吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10017010003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "以斯帖记 10:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "17010003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;犹大人末底改作亚哈随鲁王的宰相，在犹大人中为大，得他众弟兄的喜悦，为本族的人求好处，向他们说和平的话。</p>"
  }
]